<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">-Makua Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Akorintho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha yo upacha i Napaolo wa attu o Ukorintho</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Attu o Akorintho</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha yo upachera i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Attu o Ukorintho</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha yo upachera i Napaolo wa attu o Ukorintho yaalhepiye ni akarumiya Napaolo iyaakha cho 55 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo (nlhako wo 1:1). Ilha phi iwarakha yo upachera mu iwarakha pilhi chaalhempe aya Napaolo wo nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukorintho. Ni veekinaka yaalhempe ilha iwarakha ilha ikatema yaakhalha aya Uefeso ahinaya ulhakelha nkwaha aya wo Ukorintho yeetaka urwaa ni uhokolhia Umakedoniya (nlhako wo 16:5-9). Ilha iwarakha ilha phi waakhulha wa Napaolo wo malhove yeewa aya ukhuma wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yaachaka mwaha wo chittu cho uhilhoka lhoka chaapangiya munlhokoni mmo, ikhalhaka mwaha wo umwalhaana ni mihapo cho ishembwere. Iwani yo Ukorintho yaari ichuwaniaka wo mitheko chaya cho ishembwere, ihithikinehaka wiira nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yaari akumaanaka ni yoyo mwaha uyo. Ikitabu yo iwarakha yo upachera wa attu o Ukorintho tho ihaana nlhako unohimiacha mwaha wo uttunana (nlhako wo 13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina,</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anowaashikuria attu o Ukorintho ni unshukuru Nlhuku wo yayo manyaattu ayo (nlhako wo 1:1-9).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anohimiacha mwaha wiiwilhe aya unohimiacha umwalhaana mmilhokoni mwa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukorintho (nlhako wo 1:10-4:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Thothoni tho, anohimiacha mwaha wo mihapo cho ishembwere ni mwaha wo urweehaniya umilhatuni (nlhako wo 5-6).</para>
  <para style="io1">Baada yo vavawo anoohimiacha meettuchiho anaacha nthelhi, ulhapelha isinyago, ulhapelha voonene, isadaka cho munnepani ni uhihimmwa nnookhwani (nlhako wo 7-15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Anomalhiha wo uhimiacha mwaha unaacha anene ayo (nlhako wo 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Mii Paolo kiihaniye ukhalha karumiya a Kuristo Yesu wo uthanana wa Nlhuku. Mii ni munnihu Sostene, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />ninoolhepa iwarakha uwiiha uwaninyu mwaatti nlhoko wa attu a Nlhuku nrii Ukorintho nhapihiye wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo Yesu, nkamweehaniya ukhalha attu a Nlhuku, vamoka ni attu onkhaye anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, Athithi, ari awihu ni hii. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibarakha cha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku mahuku onkhaye alha wo nlhatu no uttuvani mwaattiva nnema wawe wo iphiro yo Kuristo Yesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ukhalhawaya wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo nhovahiya nhakhu wo chittu chonkhaye, vamoka ni uhimiacha nretelhe ni uvahiya irusho cho uchuwelha. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ukhalhawaya nttenga unonhimiechesha Kuristo we ikekhiaye uhokhomaalhihiya nhina mwinyu, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />nhiwukuwelhiyaka mahalha ariyoothe o munnepani vanoweherera inyu upatakulhiya wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Yoyo noukhomaalhihani mpaka umalhelha wiira mmwe mwoonia attu o uhikhuwachiya nihuku na Athithi Yesu Kuristo nne. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nlhuku owiihanneni mwaattiva nkhalhe nlhoko mmoka ni Mwaamwanawe Yesu Kuristo Athithi ri o ukhulhuvelhiya.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwalhaana nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Ashilhoko aka kinoulhepelhani wo nchina na Athithi Yesu Kuristo wiira mwiiwanane chittu chinolhumacha inyu, uhiiwanana uhikhalhe nhina mwinyu. Muupuwelheke wo irusho imoka ni nrima mmoka. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ashilhoko aka, attu akina amuchi a Nakiloe, ahohimia ikekhiaye wiira khanneewanana munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ittu kinothanana aka uhimia etu phi ilhe kiiwilhe aka uwaninyu, kila mmoka noolhumacha chawawe, mmoka neera, “Mii kinaattwara Napaolo.” Nkina, “Mii kinaattwara Naapolo.” Nkina, “Mii a Nakefa”, ni akina, “Mii a Kuristo.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Chani, Kuristo homianihiya? Chani, Napaolo phi akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani wo nlhatu winyu? Ama chani, mwaabatiiziye wo nchina ni Napaolo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku wiira akambatiizilhe ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu yaahikalheru Nakurispo ni Nagayo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Wo chiichammo etu khaawo ntu nohalha uhimia wiira batiiziye wo nchina naka. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Eiyo, kahaabatiiza attu o unupani wa Nastefana nansho uthepa yayo, akambatinze ntu nkina riyoothe.<verse eid="1CO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ukhalhawaya Kuristo khaakirumme waabatiiza attu, nansho kirumilhe uhimiacha Malhove Orera, tho, keettuchinhe wo uhikhulhuvelha irusho cho malhove a attu, ikhalhe wiira machiri o nookhwa a Kuristo vansalaabani ahirukunushiye.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuristo ni machiri ni irusho cha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ukhalhawaya nttenga wo nookhwa a Kuristo vansalaabani phi nlhove no ukumbafu wo alhe arii mu upoterani nansho wo hii noopolhiyeva, yoyo nttenga uyo phi machiri a Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Kinootanganya irusho chaya attu o irusho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">Kinoorihelha utayi ushoma waya attu ashomilhe.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Ri vayi etu, ntu o irusho? Ri vayi etu, owiittuchiha Ikekhia? Ri vayi etu ovanyiha o ilha ikatema ilha? Nlhuku hopanga irusho cho mwiilhaponi ukhalha cho uhikhalha maana.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku wo irusho chawe, attu o velhaponi khanonchuwelha Nlhuku wo iphiro yo irusho chaya ashinene. Vatulhi waya, Nlhuku hottuna woopolha attu anonrumelhelha alhe wo nttenga unohimiacha ihu, iphiro inooniya ni attu o irusho wiira yo uhikhalha maana. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Ayahudi anovekelha woona ithikineha ni Ayunani anaavia irusho <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />nansho hii ninonhimiacha Kuristo aakhomelhelhiye vansalaabani. Nttenga unoonia wa Ayahudi wiira itiyelhelho, ni ukumbafu wa attu ahiri Ayahudi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Nansho wa onkhaye eehaniye ni Nlhuku alhe, Ayahudi ni Ayunani, Kuristo phi machiri a Nlhuku ni irusho cha Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ukhalhawaya inoonia ukhalha phi ukumbafu wa Nlhuku, phi irusho upwaha irusho cha ntu ni ittu inoonia uhikhalha ni machiri wa Nlhuku, phi yo machiri upwaha machiri a attu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Ashilhoko aka, muupuwelheke vano wiira ikatema veehaniye inyu ni Nlhuku enchi inyu khamwaarina irusho cho uchuwelha chittu cho munttuni enchi khayari attu o machiri ama attu o pilhi waapwaha attu akina. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Nlhuku ahothanlha chittu choonia wiira cho ukumbafu cho mwiilhaponi wo nlhatu no woolhihacha muru attu o irusho, tho ahothanlha chittu chihiri ni machiri wiira olhihache muru attu o machiri. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Nlhuku ahothanlha chittu cho uheulhachiya cho mwiilhaponi choonia wiira phi malhove o uhikhalha maana wo nlhatu no utanganya chittu choonia ni attu wiira phi chorera ata chahaariwo. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Paahi etu, khaawo ntu nooria wiifunelha iriyoothe mmiholho mwa Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Nlhuku mwanene phi uyo olhutaninheni mwaattiva ni Kuristo Yesu. Nlhuku homvaha Kuristo akhalhe phi uchuwelha wihu, ni ikekhia ni utakatifu ni woopolhiya. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Paahi etu, thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">“Ntu neeshipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">Efunelheke etu ntheko wa Athithi.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nttenga wa Kuristo aakhomelhelhiye vansalaabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ashilhoko aka, mii vaawilhe aka uwaninyu, akohimiachenreni nttenga uvithiye wa Nlhuku wo nuulhumo noochiva, ama wo irusho ya ntu. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Vaariaka uwaninyu kaholhakelha uhichuwelha ittu iriyoothe yaahikhalheru unchuwelha Yesu Kuristo aakhomelhelhiye vansalaabani. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Vaari aka uwaninyu kaari ohuperiacha, koovaka ni uthukumelha chinene. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Malhove koolhumachilhe aka ni meettuchiho aka, akoolhumachilhe wo uchivelhihani ni wo irusho, nansho wo uhimiecheshiya chinene ni machiri o Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Kaapangilhe chiicho wo nlhatu no wiira nrima winyu ukhulhuvelhe machiri a Nlhuku, mena kuhiwe irusho cha ntu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irusho cha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, hii ninohimiacha nttenga wo irusho cha attu akhomanlhe munnepani nansho chechiyo irusho chiyo khachihiwe cho velhaponi va, mena kachihena cha ahoolhelhi anotawara ilhapo ilha ari muupoterani. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ninouhimiacherani irusho chivithiye cha Nlhuku chaalhakenlhe awe toka machokholhelho, ilhapo ihinaya wuupiya wo nlhatu no nthimicho wihu. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Khaawo ahoolhelhi o utawara o velhaponi va yaachuwenlhe chilha irusho chilha. Yakaachuwenlhe, khayaakhomelhelha Athithi o nthimicho vansalaabani. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Nansho, thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Chittu chihinapacha niitho woona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">Mena nnyaru wiiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">Chittu chihinapacha ntu wuupuwelha munrimani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">Chechiyo phi chiyo Nlhuku cheeshenre awe attu anonttuna.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nansho Nlhuku ahonipatakulhelha hii wo iphiro yo Iphumu awe. Ukhalhawaya Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowaavia kila ittu ata malhove a Nlhuku avithiye nhina hinanini. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Mpani munlhokoni mwinyu nooria uchuwelha mwaha wo nhina wa ntu ihikhalhe iphumu rii nhina mwa yoyo ntu uyo? Chiichammo etu, khaawo nochuwelha mwaha wa Nlhuku yaahikhalhe Iphumu ya Nlhuku vekha aya. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Hii khanipochenre iphumu yo velhaponi, nansho nipochenre Iphumu irumiye ni Nlhuku, wiira nikhalhe nichuwelhaka nnema uvaheriye ihu ni Nlhuku ulhe.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Paahi etu hii khaninoolhumacha wo malhove aneetuchihiya wo irusho cha ntu, nansho ninoolhumacha wo malhove anettuchihiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku nilhamulhaka ikeekhene yo munnepani wa attu arii ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Ntu riyoothe hirii ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku khanooria upochera mahalha anokhuma wa Iphumu ya Nlhuku. Attu thoko yayo khachuwenlhe mena uwannyawe yoyo ntu uyo malhove ayo anokhalha thoko ukumbafuru ukhalhawaya anochuwelhiya tu wo woorihiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Ntu riyoothe rinaa Iphumu ya Nlhuku, wo iphiro iriyoothe, nowooria uchuwelha ushichira wo kila ittu, nansho hikhalhaka ntu nooria unhukumulha. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Malhove Matakatifu aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Mpani nochuwelha irusho cha Athithi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Apani anooria weettuchiha Athithi?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Nansho inakhalhaka chiicho, hiyaano nihanaa irusho cha Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Anamitheko a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ashilhoko aka, miyaano akonrie wulhumacha ni inyu mwaatti thoko attu arii ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku. Koolhumanche ni inyu thoko attu o velhaponi, thoko ashinamwane nhina nrima wa Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Koovanheni mapelhe, kuhiwe yolhia yo ulhipa, ukhalhawaya mwaari nhinaaya vo ulhia. Eiyo, ata vano nna khannoria ulhia yolhia yo ulhipa. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ukhalhawaya bado nnokhalha thoko attu o velhaponi chinokhalha aya. Chani khuuwo woonelhana ihache ni waana indewo mwaashineneru? Yayo onkhaye ayo anooniha wiira nnokalha thoko attu o velhaponi va, wo ukhalha thoko chiri aya. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Mmoka inyu veneera awe Miyaano kinaatwara Napaolo akina Mii kinaatwara Naapolo, chani yeyo khinooniha wiira nnokalha thoko attu o velhaponi va?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Ana Naapolo phi apani? Ni Napaolo phi apani? Hiyaano anamitheko tu a Nlhuku noowihenreni mwaattiva nlhove ninorumelhelha inyu. Kila mmoka ihu novara ntheko uvahiye awe ni Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Mii kahaalha imbeyu, Naapolo nkayaahelhelha maashi, nansho Nlhuku phi melhinhe imbeyu. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Ntu aalhilhe imbeyu ni ntu michenre maashi khave ittu. Nlhuku mwanene phi melhinhe imbeyu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Ntu aalhilhe ulhe ni ntu michenre maashi ulhe, oyelhi ayo arii ittu imokaru, inakhalhaka kila mmoka nowa upochera nttuvo nawe ulhikaana ni ntheko vanre awe. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ukhalhawaya hii phi attu o nlhoko mmoka ninovara ntheko vamoka ni Nlhuku, mwaattiva phi imata ya Nlhuku ni mwaattiva phi inupa ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Wo ukavihereriya ni nnema ukivahilhe awe Nlhuku, kihooria wo irusho utheka nsingi, unthekiya vachulhu vaya ni ntu nkina. Paahi kila mmoka akhalheke miitho vanotheka awe vachulhu waya. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Khaawo ntu nooria utheka nsingi nkina ukhalhawaya Yesu Kuristo mwanene phi nsingi. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Vachulhu yoyo nsingi uyo ntu nowooria utheka wo malhuku o idhahabu ama malhuku anhaniya makhobilhi o nchurukhu ama wo malhuku makina o nhakhu mwinchi ama wo miri ama wo mathaakhuru ama wo manyashi. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Ata ikeriye chani, ulhoka wo ntheko wo kila mmoka unolhoha woonia nihuku na Kuristo nne vanohalha aya upatakulhiya. Ukhalhawaya, nenno nihuku nno mooro unowa upatakulha ntheko wa kila mmoka, ni yoyo mooro uyo unowa uphima ni wooniha ulhoka waya. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Yakhalhaka ntheko wa yoyo ntu thekilhe yoyo nsingi uyo unoowa waavilhelha yoyo mooro uyo, noowa aattuviya <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />nansho ntheko wa ntu uyo waviaka mooro, paahi, nookhwa nrima. Nansho mwanene uyo nowoopolhiya thoko howiira ukulhuphuwa ukhuma vamooroni.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira mwaattiva phi Inupa ya Nlhuku ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku nokhalha nhina mwinyu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Paahi, ntu atanganyaka Inupa ya Nlhuku, Nlhuku nontanganya ukhalhawaya Inupa ya Nlhuku phi inupa itakatifu, ni inyu mwaattiva phi Inupa ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Nhiithepiache! Ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu echoonaka ukhalha o irusho yo velhaponi, nambaya akhalhe o uhichuwelha ittu wiira apatte irusho yo ikeekhene. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ukhalhawaya, irusho cho velhaponi va phi ukumbafu uholho wa Nlhuku. Ukhalhawaya Malhove Orera aneera, “Nlhuku nowaawayiha arii ni irusho muupenyani mwaya.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Ni tho aneera, “Athithi ahochuwelha wiira waanyihera wa attu o irusho khunolhoka.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Paahi, ntu hiifunelhe mitheko cha attu. Ukhalhawaya kila ittu yawinyu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Napaolo ama Naapolo ama Nakefa ama ilhapo ama ukumi ama nookhwa ama malhove o naanano ni o kaanyuma, onkhaye awinyu. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Ni mwaattiva phi attu a Kuristo ni Kuristo phi a Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Akarumiya a Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Ntu anooneke hii etu ukhalha phi anamitheko a Kuristo nivahiye ipilhi vachulhu malhove avithiye na Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ukhulhuvelhiya phi ittu inothananiya wo ntu riyoothe vahiye ipilhi ni ukhulhuvelhiya. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Nansho uwannyaka mii, khave ittu kahukumulhiyaka ni inyu mwaatti ama uhukumulhiya ni ipuwa cha attu. Eiyo, mena mii kimwanene akineehukumulha. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Ukhalhawaya nrima aka khunokiriaa milhatu wo nlhove niriyoothe, nansho yeyo khinokaalhakelhelha ikekhia wiira akittenke. Athithi phi anokihukumulha mii. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Paahi, nhihukumulhe ikatema ihinaaya nhiyeke mpaka Athithi vanohalha aya uwa. Yayo anoowa aahumbukulha malhove eevithilhe mwiipiphini, ni wooniha mwaari mirima cha attu. Vavawo kila mmoka phi nohalha awe utotopelhiya unophwanelhiya awe ukhuma wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Ashilhoko aka, ayo onkhaye ahimianche aka waacha Naapolo ni ukaacha mii ayo phi wiilhikaaniha uwaninyu. Wo uttuna waka wiilhikaaniha mii ni Naapolo uwo, kinothanana wiira nchuwelhe maana o nna nuulhumo nna “Nrumelhelheke malhove alhepiye.” Vavawo khannowa mweeshipelha ntu mmoka ni unheulhacha ntu nkina. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Ukhalhawaya apani olhikaninheni inyuva? Nrina nipampa naani? Nansho yakhalhaka nhovahiya, nlhatuni etu no uhirumelhelha thoko khanvahiye ittu?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Haya etu, nnaanyihera wiira nhopatta kila ittu! Nhokhalha attu o nhakhu! Nhokhalha mamwene wo uhikhalha hii! Eiyo, we ikekhiaye nanthanana nkhalheke attu o utawara, wiira ni hii nitaware chiicho vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ukhalhawaya kinaanyihera wiira Nlhuku honipanga hii akarumiya va ukhalha attu o umalhelha, thoko attu ahukumulhiye wiiviya, ukhalhawaya nihokhalha attu othiachiya mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye, uholho wo minepa ni wa attu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Hii nihokhalha akumbafu wo nlhatu na Kuristo, nansho mwaattiva phi o irusho mu ulhutaanani ni Kuristo! Hii phi ohuperia, mwaatti nrii omachiri. Mwaattiva nnoohelhelhiya nansho hiyaano ninoovehachiya. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mpaka nna, hii ninoowolhiya ithalha ni nttona, khanirina ikuwo, ninowaatiya makofi ni mena khanirina mapuro.<verse eid="1CO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Tho ninoohuva ni uvara ntheko wo miono chihu naashinene. Naruwaniyaka, ninowaalhapelha ibarakha nathurulhiyaka, ninoovilhelha <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />naruwaniyaka, ninaakhulha wo umanya. Mpaka vano nihopangiya thoko unyalha wo velhaponi ni wo kila ntu hiyaano ninoonia thoko ikokholha!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Akinolhepa alha malhove alha wo nlhatu no uwulhihachani muru mwaatti, nansho wo nlhatu no uwaamukani achishaana aka kinaattuna aka. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ukhalhawaya ata nkalhanaka maelufu a attu o ulhelhani muukhalhani makhalhelho e Ikuristo, athumwaninyu kirii amoka tu. Ukhalhawaya muulhutaanani ni Kuristo yesu mii phi oyarilheni wo iphiro yo Malhove Orera.<verse eid="1CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Wo chiichammo etu, kinoulhapelhelhani wiira, ntwariheke meetelho aka. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Yoyo phi nlhatu wo waaruma Natimotheo uwaninyu. Yayo phi anaaka anaattuna aka o ukhulhuvelhiya muulhutaanani ni Athithi. Anowupushani iphiro inotwara aka muulhutaanani ni Kuristo Yesu iphiro ineettuchiha aka mwonkhaye kila vanokumaana aya attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Paahi etu munlhokoni mwinyu ahochokholha ukhalha attu aneefuna yaanyiheraka wiira akinowa uwaninyu tho. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Nansho Athithi akivaheraka, kinoowa uwaninyu chitema ni vavawo phi nohalha aka wiichonelha kimwanene, kuhiwena ittu inooria aya wulhumacha attu aneefuna ayo nansho ni ilhe anooria aya upanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ukhalhawaya umwene wa Nlhuku kuhiwe wo malhoveru, nansho wo machiri. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nnothananani? Kiwe uwaninyu kinaweelhe ikopo, ama kiwe ni nrima wo uttuna ama ni nrima wo wiitimarikha?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ulhuva uhochara mwa attu a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Malhove e ikekhiaye aheewania wiira uhaawo nhapo wo ishembwere unopangia munlhokoni mwinyu tho ishembwere yo uhilhoka ihinapacha upangia munlhokoni mwa attu ahiri Ayahudi. Kihohimeriya wiira eti mmoka inyu norupa ni mahanu a athumwanawe! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Ni inyu nnowiititihacha vavawo? Nhiifune nansho nchukulheke ni yoyo ntu pangilhe yeyo ittu iyo munthamiheke munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ni mii uwannyaka, ihookhalharu akirii wowo kimwanene wo iruttu, nansho munrimani kiri vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. Ata chiicho etu, ikhalhaka thoko kirii wowo, kihomalha unhukumulha yoyo ntu pangilhe ittu yo wuulhihacha muru uyo. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ikatema inothukumana inyu vamoka wo nchina na Athithi Yesu ni mii kikhalhaka vamoka wo nrima, paahi machiri a Athithi Yesu ari vamoka vavawo, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />mummaheke Nakare yoyo ntu uyo, iruttu awe itanganyiye, ikhalhe wiira nrima awe uwe woopolhiya nihuku na Athithi nne.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Wiifuna khunlhoka! Chani mwaatti khannochuwelha wiira ihengedure vakani inowooria ururumulha iphepa yonkhaye? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Mwiihapiheke chinene, nrihelheke utayi ihengedure yo khalhayi nkhalheke nibonji nihithakanihiye ihengedure thoko chinothananiya inyu ukhalha. Ukhalhawaya, Kuristo, mwaakhondoro ihu o Pasaka, homalha ukumihiya ukhalha isadaka. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Paahi, niterekheke ikaramu iyo ihikhalhaka yo nkatte uthakanihiye ihengedure yo khalhayi, ihengedure yo unanara ni uhilhoka, nansho yo nkatte wo uhithakanihiya ihengedure, nkatte wo urera nrima ni ikeekhene.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Nhina iwarakha aka kaalhempe wiira nhivaraane ni attu o ulhuva. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Ikekheene iri wiira akaacha attu onkhaye velhaponi anlhuva ama attu o ilhema ama attu owoothacha ama anlhapelha mashoka. Ukhalhawaya, waashemba attu onkhaye ayo ikaathananiye mwaattivava uthama velhaponi va! <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Ittu yaalhepilhe aka phi ilha, nhivaraane ni nhima inyu Nkuristo rii ntu o ulhuva ama ntu o ilhema ama nolhapelha mashoka ama ntu o waaniha attu ama ntu o uhapalhiya ama ntu owiiya. Ntu o yayo meetelho ayo, ata yolhia nhinlhiane. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Chani, phi nlhove naka waahukumulha attu ahirii munlhokoni mwinyu? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Yayo Nlhuku phi nohalha awe waahukumulha. Ama chani mwaatti khannothananiya waahukumulha attu arii munlhokoni mwinyu? Mmwomolhelheke utayi yoyo ntu o uhilhoka uyo!<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Milhatu cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Nooria chani mmoka inyu unrweeha nlhoko awe nrumelhenlhe Kuristo nkhunanawe upuwani wa attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku unhukumulhani ni uhiya unrweeha upuwani wa atakatifu a Nlhuku? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ama chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira attu a Nlhuku phi nowa uhukumulha ilhapo? Yakhalhaka etu, ilhapo inowa uhukumulhiya ni inyu mwaatti, nlhatuni etu no uhiphwanelhiya uhukumulha ata malhove makani? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Chani, khannochuwelha wiira wo uthepa ninoowa naakhalha o uhukumulha ata minepa o wiirimu? Vamoka ni uhukumulha malhove makani o kila nihuku. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Vanokhalha inyu ni milhatu cho uhiiwanana cho malhove inyu o mahuku ene, nlhatuni etu no weehana uwa uhukumulhani attu ahinaalhoha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ana khannokelhiya nipampa! Niireke wiira khaawo ata ntu mmoka munlhokoni mwinyu rii ni irusho cho wooria uhukumulha malhove o uhiiwananiya a attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Nansho nholhemalhelha ntu unrweeha nhima awe umilhatuni, tho uholho wa attu ahinrumelhenlhe Kuristo wiira ahukumulhiye.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Wo ikekhiaye wowo ukuulhumelha chittu cho uhilhoka mwaashineneru uwo, unowooniha wiira nhokufia chinene! Chani, khanaari nlhove norera chinene mwaatti uthurulhiya? Ama khayaarera chinene mwaatti waakhiya mihakhu chinyu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Nansho, vatulhi waya, mwaatti phi inyu nnopanga chittu cho uhilhoka ni waakhacha, tho, yayo nnaapangelha achihima inyu! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ama chani, khannochuwelha wiira attu o uhilhoka khanowa aahiyeriya umwene wa Nlhuku? Nhiithepiache! Attu ankhalhelha mwaha wo ulhuva ama anolhapelha mashoka ama o ishembwere ama anorupa ni alhopwana nanaya <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />ama owiiya ama o ilhema ama o uhapalhiya ama o waapa ama o uvara makhuche, yayo onkhaye ayo khanowa yaakelha Imwene ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Attu akina munlhokoni mwinyu mwaari thoko chiicho nansho vano nhaalhakelhiya, nkamwathanlhiya ukhalha oombone ni uratihiya ni Nlhuku wo nchina na Athithi Yesu Kuristo ni wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntumiyeke iruttu chinyu wo nthimicho wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Ntu nowooria uhimia wiira “Wo mii kila ittu inookilhoka.” Eiyo nansho kiheena kila ittu inolhoka uwannyaka. Kinoorumelhelha wiira kila ittu inorera nansho akinottuna utawariya ni ikuru iriyoothe. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Nnowooria wiira, “Yolhia irii wo nlhatu no nthunkwa ni nthunkwa nirii wo nlhatu no yolhia.” Eiyo nansho Nlhuku noowa aatanganya chonkhaye pilhi chiyo. Iruttu ya ntu kihiwe wo nlhatu wo ulhavalhava nansho wo nlhatu na Athithi ni Athithi wo nlhatu no iruttu. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Paahi, Nlhuku aahihimunshe Athithi unookhwani nonihihimusha ni hii chiicho wo machiri awe.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Chani, khannochuwelha wiira iruttu chinyu phi itturi cho iruttu ya Kuristo? Chani, kikusheke itturi cha Kuristo ni upanga ukhalha itturi cha nthiyana o ulhavalhava? Ata vakani mena! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ukhalhawaya, thoko chinochuwelha inyu, ntu nolhutaana ni nthiyana o ulhavalhava nokhalha iruttu imoka ni uyo thoko chilhepiye aya, “Ni ayo elhi ayo anookhalha iruttu imoka.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Nansho ntu lhutaanne ni Athithi nokhalha nnepa mmoka ni ayo. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Nshembeke kabisa iphiro cho muulhuvani. Uwonya ukina wonkhaye khunopangiya mwiiruttuni nansho ulhavalhava unopangiya mwiiruttuni wa ntu mwanene. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ama chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira iruttu chinyu phi Inupa ya Iphumu ya Nlhuku rii nhina mwinyu, mwaapochenre inyu ukhuma wa Nlhuku? Mwaattiva etu, iruttu chinyu khachihiwe nhakhu inyu mwaashinene. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Mwaatti mwoopolhiye wo nhakhu mwinchi. Paahi etu, iruttu chinyu chinthimicheke Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo uthelha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Vano kinaacha malhove yaalhepilhe inyu alhe, eiyo, ihorera nlhopwana ahalhaka wo uhithelha <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />nansho wo nlhatu wo itatako yo ulhikachiya muulhuvani, paahi etu kila nlhopwana akhalheke ni mahanu awe mwanene ni kila nthiyana akhalheke ni owannyawe. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Nlhopwana apangeke chinophwanelhiya upanga wa mahanu awe ni nthiyana uyo apangeke chinothananiya awe upanga wa owannyawe. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Nthiyana kharina ikuru vachulhu iruttu awe, nansho owannyawe ahaana ni nlhopwana uyo chiichammo, kharina ikuru vachulhu iruttu awe nansho mahanu awe phirina. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Nhithuwane, yaahikhalhe mweewananaka mwaashineneru wiira chiicho wo nipesha nikani, mwoorie upatta nipesha noombone no unlhapelha Nlhuku. Mwamalhaka nhokolhelhaneke chitema, Nakare hiwe o ulhikachani wo nlhatu no uhichooria winyu wiichinanelha.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Nna nlhove kinohimia aka vano nna ikano, kuhiwena malhehero. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Kaanothanana wiira attu onkhaye akhalheke thoko mii chiriaka nansho kila mmoka hanaa mahalha avaheriye awe ukhuma wa Nlhuku mmoka vaheriye ilha ni ntu nkina vaheriye ilhe.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Paahi, alhe ahinathelhiya ni alhe akhwelhiye manyowannyaya kinaahimeria wiira athepeke ukhalha wo uhithelhiya ama uthelha thoko mii. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Nansho inakhalhaka chiicho, nlhopwana aahorieke wiichinanelha, paahi etu athelheke ukhalhawaya irii mbaya chinene uthelha kuliko ukelhiya itama.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Wa attu athelhanne alhe kihanaa malhehero, tho ahikhalhaka awaka, nansho ya Athithi, nthiyana himwalhaane ni owannyawe <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />nansho amwalhaanaka, paahi ahalheke wo uhithelhiya ama etu, eewananihiyeke ni owannyaya. Nlhopwana ni uyo himwalhaane ni mahanu awe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Wa attu akina alhe, mii kimwanene kuhiwe Athithi, kineera choo, Yakhalhaka munnihu nrumelhenlhe Kuristo hanaa ahanu awe ahinarumelhelha, ni uyo nkaattuna ukhalha ni ayo, aakhalhaneke etu, himmwalhaane. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Vavawo tho, yakhalhaka nthiyana nrumelhenlhe Kuristo hothelhiya ni nlhopwana hinanrumelhelha Kuristo ni uyo nlhopwana uyo hottuna ukhalha ni ayo, paahi etu nthiyana uyo himwalhaane ni owannyawe ayo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ukhalhawaya nlhopwana hinanrumelhelha Kuristo uyo nohapihiya uhilhoka wawe wo ulhutaana ni mahanu awe ni uyo nthiyana o uhirumelhelha noteelhihiya wa Nlhuku wo unlhoko ni owannyawe. Wo iphiro ikina achishaana ayo khayaakhalha ashaana a Nlhuku nansho vano phi attu awe Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Nansho yakhalhaka ulhe o uhirumelhelha nothanana unhiya ntunanawe nrumelhenlhe Kuristo, paahi etu anhiyeke. Vavawo nlhoko ihu nrumelhenlhe Kuristo uyo, nlhopwana ama nthiyana nookhalha wo uhittukiya. Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku howiihanani mwaattiva mpangiye o ukhalha ni mpuha. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Inyuva amanyi munrumelhenlhe Kuristo va, nnooria chani ukhalha ni ikekhiaye wiira khannooria woopolha owannyu? Ama inyuva thithi nri Akuristo va, nnooria chani ukhalha ni ikekhiaye wiira khannooria woopolha ahanu inyu?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkhalheke thoko chiihaniye inyu ni Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Nansho yakhalhaka ntu khaneenelhiya nkeehaniya ni Athithi, akhalheke thoko chiri awe wo uhinelhiya. Alha phi malhove anolhehera aka wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Yakhalhaka ntu heehaniya ni Nlhuku neenelhiye unyawo, paahi hilhikache wiirukunusha wiira kheenelhiye ni vavawo yakhalhaka ntu ehaniye nari hineenelhiya, paahi etu hiinelhiye. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ukhalhawaya wiinelhiya unyawo ama uhiinelhiya khave ittu, ittu yuulhupalhe irii uvara malhehero a Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Paahi, kila mmoka akhalheke thoko chaari awe ikatema yeehaniye awe ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Chani, inyuva mwaari ipotta ikatema yeehaniye inyu? Aye, nhikelhiye nipampa nansho mwapattaka nipesha no uneethi ntumiyeke. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ukhalhawaya ntu ehaniye ni Athithi nari ipotta uyo, yoyo nookhalha neethi wa Athithi. Phi chiichammo ni uyo ehaniye nari neethi, nookhalha ipotta ya Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mwaatti onkhaye mwoopolhiye wo nhakhu paahi etu nhikhalhe tho ipotta cha attu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Ashilhoko aka, kila mmoka inyu ahalheke ni Nlhuku thoko chaari awe ikatema yeehaniye awe.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inaacha athupa ni manyoopani akhwelhiye ni manyowannyaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Vano, wo mwaha unaacha manyaathiyana ahinaatameriya ni athupa, akirina malhehero ukhuma wa Athithi nansho kinokumiha nlhove naka mii, kivaheriye wo ikiriri cha Athithi ukhalha o ukhulhuvelhiya. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Paahi, wo nlhatu wo uhuva urii vano, kinoona yanlhoka ntu ukhalha thoko chiri awe. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Chani, nhothelha? Paahi, nhithanane umwalhaana ni mahanu inyu. Inyuva khanthenlhe? Paahi, nhithelhe. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Nansho mwathelhaka khannowonya ni mwalhi athelhiyaka khanowonya. Attu anohalha uthelhana ayo anoopatta itatako cho velhaponi va, nansho mii kaathanana wiira yayo ahuupatteni mwaattiva.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Ashilhoko aka, kineera choo, ikatema ihanlhe ihokhuviaa. Ni toka vano attu athenlhe akhalheke thoko khathenlhe, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />attu anonlha akhalheke thoko khanonlha, ni attu anteelhiya akhalheke thoko khanteelhiya ni attu anothuma akhalheke thoko khaarina ittu <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />ni attu arii ni mitheko cho velhaponi va akhalheke thoko khaarina choopanga chinene ni ayo, ukhalhawaya ilhapo ilha, thoko chinochuwelha ihu, inoovira.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nansho kinothanana mwaatti nhikelhiye nipampa. Ntu hinathelha naachenjeukelha Athithi iphiro chinohalha awe waateelhiha Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Nlhopwana thenlhe nochenjeukelha chittu cho velhaponi iphiro chinohalha awe waateelhiha nrima mahanu awe, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />ni uyo homianiaa. Nthiyana hithelhiye ama nthiyana hinaatameriya ni nlhopwana nochenjeuka ni malhove a Athithi wiira ekumihe iruttu ni nrima awe akhalhe ntakatifu. Nansho nthiyana thelhiye nochenjeuka ni malhove o velhaponi va, iphiro chinohalha awe waateelhiha owannyawe.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Kinoohimeriani chommo wo ifaida inyu, mena kuhiwe wo wuchiichihani. Kinothanana wiira nkhalheke o ulhokalhoka, wiira mwaatumikelhe Athithi wo uhimianiaa.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Yakhalhaka nlhopwana nowoona wiira khanompangelha rata nthiyana mwalhi nvekilhe awe wo uhinthelha hoolhuvalha ni yakhalhaka itama chawe chinommulhusha, apangeke etu chinothanana awe, athelhaneke tu khanowonya. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Nansho yakhalhaka nlhopwana uyo attunaka wo uthanana mu nrimani mwawe uhithelha kharina nlhatu, ni vavawo ooriaka utawara machiri o itama chawe ni uchuwelha iphiro yo upanga, paahi, hopanga rata chinene ahinthelheke uyo ntunanawe hinaatameriya uyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Paahi wo malhove makina, ntu nothanana uveka ulhe nopanga yorera ni ulhe nohalha wo uhithelha nopanga morera chinene.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Nthiyana thelhiye noottukiya ni owannyawe wo ikatema yonkhaye owannyawe vanokhalha aya akumi. Nansho owannyawe akhwaaka, yayo opani ayo ahohiyereriya, attunaka anowooria uthelhiya ni ntu riyoothe, nansho akhalheke ntu arumelhenlhe Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Nansho, chinoona aka mii anooreeriya chinene akaakhanlhe chiicho thoko chiri aya. Yayo phi noonaka mii uno kaanyiheraka ni mii chiicho kihanaa Iphumu ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo cholhia chilhapelhiye mashoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Vano mwaha unaacha isadaka yo cholhia chilhapelhiye mashoka. Nihochuwelha wiira hiyaano onkhaye va nihanaa irusho, nansho irusho chiyo chinowaapanga attu yeeshipe nansho uttuna phi notheka. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Ntu eeraka wiira hochuwelha ittu, wo ikekhiaye khachuwenlhe ittu iriyoothe thoko chinothananiya awe. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ntu anttunaka Nlhuku, Nlhuku ni uyo nonchuwelha yoyo ntu uyo.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Paahi etu, mwaha unaacha isadaka yo cholhia chilhapelhiye mashoka, nihochuwelha wiira we ikekhiaye mashoka khave ittu velhaponi va ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku ri mmoka tu. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ata yakhalhaka wiira chihaawo chittu chineehaniya milhuku velhaponi ama wiirimu, ni ata akhalhaka thoko chihawo milhuku ni manyaathithi enchi, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />nansho uwanihu hii Nlhuku rii mmoka tu, Athumwanihu Oopilhe chonkhaye rii wo nlhatu nawe hii nihawo. Tho Athithi arii amoka tu, Yesu Kuristo, rii wo iphiro awe chittu chonkhaye chahoopiya, ni hii ninolhokelha wo iphiro awe.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Nansho, kuhiwe kila ntu chuwenlhe ulha mwaha ulha. Ukhalhawaya ahawo attu akina alhemalhenlhe ulhapelha mashoka, attu arii mpaka nna vanolhia aya yeyo isadaka yo yolhia iyo anoona thoko chiholhapelhiya mashoka. Ni ukhalhawaya mirima chaya chihoochaa, anookelhiya nsheru. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nansho yolhia khinooria unaatameriha chinene wa Nlhuku. Naahilhieke khaninowukuwelhiya ittu, nalhiaka khaninonchereriya ittu.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Nansho, mmweheke rata cholhia chinolhia inyu, ikuru ihu ilha ihaapange arii ni nrima mwankani awulhuwe mu uwonyani. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ukhalhawaya, ntu o nrima wo uhuperia, owoonakani inyuva nrii ni irusho nlhiaka isadaka yo yolhia chiyo nnupani mwo ulhapelhiya mashoka, chani, khannonhelha nrima ni uyo wo ulhia cholhia chilhapelhiye mashoka? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Chiicho, nhima inyu o nrima mwankani uyo, Kuristo nkhwenlhe awe wo nlhatu nawe, noopotera wo nlhatu no irusho chinyu. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Yakhalhaka nnowaawonyiha achihima inyu yeyo iphiro iyo, ni urakalhiha nrima waya wo uhuperia, ni inyu nnonttekelha Kuristo ni achihima inyu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Wo chiichammo etu, yakhalhaka yolhia inommulhusha nhima aka, akinokhuura inama tho mahuku o uhimalha, ukhalhawaya kalhiaka kinommulhusha Kuristo ni ummulhusha nhima aka mu uwonyani.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Malhove anaacha mitheko cha Akarumiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Chani, mii akihiwe neethi? Chani, mii akihiwe karumiya? Chani, mii akimwoonne Yesu, Athithi? Chani, mwaattiva kanhiwe phi mahalha o ntheko aka wo nlhatu wa Athithi? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ata yakhalhaka wiira wa attu akina mii akihiwe karumiya, nansho uwaninyu mwaatti mii karumiya. Ni inyu mwaatti phi o himiechesha urumiya waka wo nlhatu no ulhutaana winyu na Athithi.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Nlhove naka no uwaahukumulha attu anokivinga phi nna, <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Chani, hii khanirina ikuru yo ulhia ni uwuria? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Chani, khanirina ikuru yo waakusha manyaahanu ihu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo munkwahani mwihu, thoko chinopanga aya akarumiya akina ni ashilhoko aya Athithi ni Nakefa chiicho? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Ama ni mii tu ama Nabanaba ari ni ikuru yo uvara ntheko ni upatta mahalha ihu? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Chani, nsikari ani neelhivelha ntheko awe? Namalhima ani hinolhia izabibu cho mmatani mwawe? Nshunga ani hinowuria mapelhe o mihuwo chawe?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Chani, kinoolhumacha alha malhove alha wo ikuru yo munttuniru? Chani, Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni iyo khineera chiicho? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ukhalhawaya Malhehero a ashinna Musa aholhepiya wiira, “Nhittuke iyano ing'ope vanokhungura aya cholhia.” Chani, niireke Nlhuku noochenjeuka ni ing'ope? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Chani, hii khanopuwenlhe veerilhe awe chiicho? Eiyo, alha aalhepiye wo nlhatu nihu, ukhalhawaya ulhe nolhima ni ulhe nokhungura, onkhaye oyelhi ahaana nrima wo ukhulhuvelha upatta mahalha. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Yakhalhaka etu hii nihaalha imbeyu yo munnepani munlhokoni mwinyu, chani, khavanolhoka chinene nakhunguraka ifaida ukhuma mwiiruttuni mwinyu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Yakhalhaka akina anoweherera ukaviha winyu mwaatti, chani, hii khanirina ikuru chinene waapwaha yayo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Nansho, hiyaano khanatumiilhe wowo uphwanelhiya uwo. Utulhi waya, nihovilhelha kila ittu wiira nihitiyelhelhe Malhove Orera a Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira attu anovara ntheko u Inupa ya Nlhuku anopatta malhivo o ntheko waya ni attu anokumiha isadaka chaya umadhubahuni anoopatta ittu ukhuma yeyo isadaka iyo? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Athithi yaholhehera chiicho wiira attu anohimiacha Malhove Orera a Nlhuku apatteke ittu yo waakavihera mwommo.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Nansho, mii akitumiilhe ata ittu imoka wo yayo malhove ayo. Ni mena akinolhepa wiira kipatte chechiyo chittu chiyo. Uwannyaka mii, nambaya ukhwa kuliko uchiichihiya ni ntu riyoothe wiishipa uneeshipa aka. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Yakhalhaka kinoohimiacha Malhove Orera, yoyo kuhiwe nlhatu wo wiifunelha, yoyo phi ntheko uvahiye aka. Nansho kinoothapana mii kaahihimiacheke Malhove Orera! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Yakhalhaka kahovara ulha ntheko ulha wo uttuna waka, paahi, kaanoweherera malhivo nansho wo uhittuna waka, yeyo phi ipilhi kirumelhelhiyaka ni Nlhuku wiira kivare. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Malhivo aka phi ishiyani etu? Malhivo aka phi nipesha kivahiye aka no uhimiacha Malhove Orera wo uhilhiviya, wo uhikoherera malhivo o ikuru aka yo uhimiacha Malhove Orera.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ihookhalharu mii akipangiye ipotta yo ntu riyoothe, kiheepanga ukhalha ipotta yo kila ntu wiira kimpattelhe Kuristo attu enchi inooriacha aya. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Wo Ayahudi kaakhanlhe thoko Nyahudi wiira kaapatte Ayahudi, ihookhalharu akinotawariya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa kiheechesha wuuthi Malhehero uwannyaya, wiira kaapatte alhe arii atawariyaka ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Ni wo alhe ahinotawariya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa alhe, kinokhalha thoko yayo, wo uhitawariya ni Malhehero, wiira kaapatte o uwonya ayo, anotawariya ni Malhehero ayo. Ilha kiheena wiira mii akinotawariya ni Malhehero a Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya kihovariya ni Malhehero a Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Wa attu arii o nrima mwankani kiheepanga ntu o nrima mwankani thoko yayo chiri aya wiira kaapatte alhe arii ni nrima mwankani. Kihopanga kila ittu wo nlhatu no attu onkhaye wiira koopolhe akina aya wo kila iphiro.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Kinopanga chonkhaye chii wo nlhatu no Malhove Orera, wiira kikavihane upatta ibarakha chaya. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira mpuwani nnothweelhiya mihapo, ihookhalharu attu enchi phi nottawa nansho ntu mmoka noholhelha phi nottuviya. Nttaweke chiicho ni inyu nttuviye. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Attu ottawa vaneechesha aya rata anaatakanelha wiira apatte nttuvo ninotanganyiaa! Nansho hii ninopanga chiicho wiira niwarihiye mphumburu uhinothaalha. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Phi chiichammo etu, kinottawa thoko ntu o itama yo upatta nttuvo, phi chiichammo etu kinaatakana thoko owatakana hinokufia ikhwipi chawe vahiri ittu. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Nansho kinoohuviha iruttu aka kimwanene ukhalha ipotta aka, kinopanga chiicho kihiwe mii kimwanene kaakhotiya vanomalhiha aka waahimiachera attu akina Malhove Orera.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya mwaha wo ulhapelhiya mashoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Ashilhoko aka, kinothanana nchuwelheke wiira manyaapwiihu onkhaye yaari wuuthi nihute nne, ni wiira onkhaye yaholhapuwa rata ibahari ilhe. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Onkhaye yahobatiiziya wo ulhutaana ni ashinna Musa nnihuteni mmwe ni nhina ibahari ilhe. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Onkhaye yaholhia yeyo yolhia yo munnepani iyo, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />tho nkayawuria chiicho yo uwuria yelhe yo munnepani ilhe, ukhalhawaya yawunrie ukhuma mwalha wo munnepani waattwarilhe ulhe, yoyo mwalha uyo waari Kuristo mwanene. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, enchi aya khayantelhinhe Nlhuku, ni mitembo chaya chahomwarushiya uthakoni.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Paahi etu, malhove onkhaye ayo phi olhikaanihiya uwanihu wiira anaamuke hiyaano nihithanane ukhalha attu o uhilhoka thoko chenre aya wo uthanana yayo manyaattu ayo. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Mena nhikhalhe attu o ulhapelha mashoka thoko chinohimiya ni Malhove Matakatifu wiira, “Attu yahokhalhacha nkayaalhia ni uwuria, nkayeemelha ni wiinacha chittu cho unanara.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Mena nihilhuve thoko chaalhuvilhe aya, nkayaakhwacha attu 23,000. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Mena nihinlhikache Kuristo thoko chaalhikanche aya attu akina, nkayaalhumachiya inwaa, nkayaakhwaacha. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Mena nhichukulhe thoko akina chenre aya wo uchukulhacha, nkayeevakachiya.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Paahi, yoyo mwaha waapattilhe uyo phi meettuchiho uwanihu, ni ayo yaalhepiye wo nlhatu no unaamuka hiyaano nipochenre utimira ni umalha wo ikatema.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ntu naanyihera wiira heemelha rata, paahi etu akhalheke miitho hiwulhuwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ulhikachiya umanlhe inyu upatta phi wo mahuku ene wa attu. Nlhuku ri o ukhulhuvelhiya, khanoohiyani wiira nlhikachiye upwaha wooria winyu. Nansho vamoka ni ulhikachiya uwo nouvahani chiicho machiri o uvilhelha ni iphiro yo ukhuma muulhikachiyani mmo rata.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Paahi etu, manyampwana kinaattuna aka, nshembeke mwaha wo ulhapelha mashoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Kinoolhumacha ni mwaattiva, attu nrii ni irusho, nchuwelheke mwaashinene malhove anoolhumacha aka ayo. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Vanontotopelha ihu Nlhuku wo ikikombe yo ibarakha ilhe, chani, khaninolhutaana ni iphome ya Kuristo? Vanomia ihu nkatte, chani, khaninokhalha nlhoko mmoka ni iruttu ya Kuristo?<verse eid="1CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Ukhalhawaya nkatte uyo urii mmoka, inakhalhaka hii nirii enchi, nirii iruttu imoka, ukhalhawaya onkhaye ninomiana yoyo nkatte mmoka uyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Mwooneke attu o Israeli chiri aya wo ulhutaana ni Nlhuku, attu anolhiacha isadaka chikumihiye umadhubahuni. Chani yayo khanokaviha mitheko cho madhubahuni unokumihiya isadaka? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Paahi kuulhumacheke ittu yaani? Chani kiireke wiira yolhia ikumihiye isadaka wa Nlhuku phi ittu yo maana upwaha yolhia ikina? Ni mashoka ayo chani phi ittu yo maana? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ata vakani! Inoolhumacha aka irii wiira isadaka cha attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku chinokumihiya ni uvahiya mashoka, kaheena Nlhuku. Akinottuna mena wiira mwaattiva nkavihane ni mashoka.<verse eid="1CO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Khannooria uwureria ikikombe ya Athithi uno mmwureriaka ikikombe yo mashoka, khannooria umiana vamoka ni Athithi ni ulhia vamoka ni mashoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ama chani, ninothanana waapanga Athithi akhalhe o ihache? Nnaanyihera wiira nihanaa machiri chinene waapwaha yayo?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kila ittu irii wo nthimicho wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Chittu chonkhaye khachinochiichihiya, nansho khachihiwe chonkhaye chinorera. Chittu chonkhaye khachinochiichihiya nansho khachihiwe chonkhaye chinotheka. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Ntu haavie ifaida awe mwanene, nansho aavieke mahalha a akhunanawe.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Nkhuureke inama iriyoothe inothumihiya usokoni wo uhikohakoha wo nlhatu no mirima chinyu. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Ilhapo ni chittu chonkhaye chiriwo phi nhakhu wa Athithi.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Yakhalhaka ntu hinrumelhenlhe Kuristo noulhalhiani mwaattiva ni inyu nkamwaarwaa, paahi, nlhieke inama chonkhaye chinolhoha awe uterekhelhani wo uhikohakoha wo nlhatu no mirima chinyu. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Nansho yakhalhaka ntu nowiira, “Ilha inama ilha ihokumihiya ikhalhe isadaka yo ulhapelhiya mashoka.” Paahi, wo nlhatu wo nrima wawe uyo ohimenrieni chiicho uyo nhilhie. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Mii kineera wo nlhatu no nrima kuhena nrima winyu, nansho nrima awe uyo ohimenrieni uyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Nlhatu waani etu, uneethi aka uhukumulhiye ni nrima wa ntu nkina? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Yakhalhaka mii kinonshukuru Nlhuku wo yolhia inolhia aka, nlhatuni etu no uruwaniya wo mwaha wo yolhia irii wo nlhatu waya kihonshukuru Nlhuku?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Paahi, ittu iriyoothe inopanga inyu ikhalhe ulhia ama uwuria, mpangeke chonkhaye wo nlhatu no unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Nhikhalhe nlhatu wo waattekiha Ayahudi ama Ayunani ama attu arumelhenlhe Athithi Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Nkhalheke thoko chiri aka mii, kinoolhikacha unteelhiha kila mmoka wo kila iphiro, wo uhaavia ifaida aka kimwanene nansho ifaida ya attu onkhaye, wiira oopolhiye.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Nkithakiheke mii thoko mii chinonthakiha aka Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhuneelha muru ikatema yo unlhapelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Kinowutotopelhani wo nlhatu no ukupuwelha ni wo nlhatu no uvarechesha meettuchiho yuvahilheakani alhe. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Nansho kinothanana nchuwelheke wiira Kuristo phi muru vachulhu wo kila nlhopwana ni nlhopwana phi muru vachulhu wo mahanu awe ni Nlhuku phi muru vachulhu Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Paahi, kila nlhopwana nolhapelha ama rii namilhohi a Nlhuku uno neekhunenlhe muru awe, yoyo noveehacha muru awe. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ni nthiyana alhapelhaka ama namilhohi a nttenga wa Nlhuku wo uhikhunelha muru, naaveehacha owannyawe, nthiyana nopanga chiicho nokhalha thoko nthiyana hammee ikharari chawe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Nthiyana hinokhuneelha muru awe, ambaya ahameke ikharari chawe. Nansho inowulhihacha muru nthiyana ahamaka ikharari chawe ama uhamiya, paahi ambaya etu akhuneelheke muru awe. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Khinolhoka nlhopwana wiikhuneelha muru awe, ukhalhawaya yoyo phiri thoko Nlhuku ni nthimicho wa Nlhuku nansho nthiyana phi nthimicho wa nlhopwana. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Nlhopwana khaakhumilhe wa nthiyana, nansho nthiyana aakhumme wa nlhopwana. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Nlhopwana khoopiye wo nlhatu no nthiyana, nansho nthiyana oopiyee wo nlhatu no nlhopwana. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Paahi etu nthiyana akhuneelheke muru awe, ikhalheke ittu yo wooniha ikuru irii vachulhu vawe ni tho wo nlhatu no minepa o wiirimu.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Nansho ata inakhalhaka chiicho, uholho wa Athithi khaawo nthiyana wo uhikhalha nlhopwana, ni uyo nlhopwana khanokhalha wo uhikhalha nthiyana. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ukhalhawaya thoko nthiyana chikhumelhenlhe awe wa nlhopwana ni chiichammo nlhopwana noyariya ni nthiyana, nansho kila ittu inokhuma wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Nhukumulheke mwaashinene, Chani, iholhoka nthiyana unlhapelha Nlhuku wo uhikhunelha ittu mmuruni? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ata moopelho anene ari aya anooniha mwaari wiira wo nlhopwana ukhalha ni ikharari cho urekama inomuulhihacha muru mwanene, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />nansho wo nthiyana ukhalha ni ikharari phi ittu yo nthimicho uwannyawe, vahiye ikharari cho urekama wiira chinkhuneelhe. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Yakhalhaka ntu nothanana uwiiha mwaha wo uvaanyihana vachulhu ulha mwaha ulha, paahi achuwelheke wiira hiyaano khanirina malhemalhelho makina mena attu a Nlhuku anrumelhenlhe Kuristo kharina malhemalhelho makina.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yolhia ya Athithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-29">Mat 26:6-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mak 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Vanouvahaakani malhehero alha, akinooria utotopelhani ata vakani. Ukumaana winyu mwaatti anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, unowiiha chittu cho ulhoka nansho unowiiha uhilhoka. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Wo uchokholha, kiheewa wiira vanokumaana inyu vamoka attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, uhiiwanana unookhumelhelha variyari inyu. Ni mii kinorumelhelha vakani. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ukhalhawaya anookhumelhelha malhove ovirikanacha munlhokoni mwinyu, wiira alhe arumelhelhiye we ikekhiaye achuwanie. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Eiyo we ikekhiaye nnokumaana, nansho kuhena wo nlhatu no ulhia yolhia ya Athithi! <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ukhalhawaya vanolhia inyu kila mmoka nokhalhelha yolhia awe mwanene wo uhaaweherera attu akina. Ata inokhumelhelha wiira attu akina ahalhaka ni ithalha, ni attu akina anahapalhiye! <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Chani, khannooria ulhia ni uwuria mmanupani mwinyu? Ama chani, nnoveehacha nlhoko wa attu a Nlhuku ni wolhihachiha muru ayo ahirii ni ittu ayo? Kuhimeriekeni ittu yaani? Kuushipeni? Mena! Ata mena, kuhena wo ulha mwaha ulha.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ukhalhawaya mii kahopochera ukhuma wa Athithi nlhove kovahilhe akani, wiira yolhe uhiyu ulhe Athithi Yesu vaathumihiye aya, ahokusha nkatte <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />nkayanshukuru Nlhuku, nkayaamia, nkayeera, “Ilha phi iruttu aka ikumihiye wo nlhatu winyu, mpangeke chiicho wo ukuupuwelha.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Chiichammo vaamanlhe aya ulhia nkatte yahokusha ikikombe nkayeera, “Ilha phi ikikombe yo Malhehano o Naanano o iphome aka, mwiireke chiicho kila vanohalha inyu uwuria wo ukuupuwelha.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ukhalhawaya kila vanolhia inyu ulha nkatte ulha ni uwureria ilha ikikombe ilha, nnoonhimiacha nookhwa a Athithi, mpaka vanohalha aya uwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Paahi etu, kila ntu nolhia yoyo nkatte uyo ama nowuria ikikombe ya Athithi vahinothananiya, nootteka wo nlhatu no iruttu ni iphome ya Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Paahi kila ntu akhalheke ni wiikoha mwanene hinaaya ulhia nkatte ni uwuria yeyo ikikombe iyo, <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe nolhia ni uwuria wo uhichuwelha ikekhiaye yo iruttu ya Athithi, nolhia ni uwuria ihukumu awe mwanene. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Yoyo phi nlhatu wa attu akina munlhokoni mwinyu ukhalha ohuperia ni akina areta ni akina ukhalha o ukhwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Yakaari naheechuwelha we ikekhiaye, khanaahukumulhiya chiicho. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Nansho vanohukumulhiya ihu na Athithi nineettuchihiya ukhalha ni irusho wiira nihiwe naahukumulhiya vamoka ni ilhapo.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Paahi etu ashilhoko aka vanokumaana inyu ulhia yolhia ya Athithi, kila mmoka anlhiteke nkhunanawe. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Ntu wolhiye ithalha alhieke uwannyawe wiira ukumaana winyu uhiwiihe ihukumu. Nansho wo mwaha wa makina alhe kinoowa koolheherani vanohalha aka uwa.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Uvaheriya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Ashilhoko aka, vachulhu mahalha o munnepani, kinothanana nchuwelheke rata alha malhove alha. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Nhochuwelha wiira, vaari inyu attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku, mwaahoolhelhiya ni upoterihiya ni isinyago chihiri ni ukumi. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Paahi, nchuwelheke wiira ntu riyoothe noholhelhiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku khanooria wulhumacha wiira, “Yesu alhaviye!” Ni chiichammo, ntu riyoothe hinoholhelhiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku khanooria wiira, “Yesu phi Athithi.”<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Mahalha o Iphumu ya Nlhuku ari menchi, nansho Iphumu ya Nlhuku rii mmoka. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Iphiro cho ukaviha ntheko wa Athithi chiri chinchi nansho Athithi arii amoka. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Chihawo iphiro chinchi cho uvara ntheko, nansho Nlhuku rii mmoka, nooriha mitheko chonkhaye mwa attu onkhaye. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Iphumu ya Nlhuku neepatakulha wa kila ntu wo ifaida ya attu onkhaye. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Iphumu ya Nlhuku nommaha ntu mmoka nttenga wo irusho, ni ummaha ntu nkina mahalha o uchuwelha chittu, chinothanana aya yeyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku uyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Iphumu ya Nlhuku yoyo nommaha ntu mmoka nrima, ni ummaha ntu nkina mahalha o waalhamiha attu.<verse eid="1CO 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Tho inommaha ntu mmoka mahalha o upanga cho ushangiha, nkina mahalha o anamilhohi, nkina mahalha o ulhamulha mahalha anovahiya ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni nlhoko wo chittu chihiri cho Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nkina mahalha o uchuwelha nuulhumo nilheto ni nkina mahalha o ulhamulha nuulhumo nilheto. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo phi mitheko cho yeyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku mmoka uyo. Nommaha kila ntu mahalha ovirikanacha, thoko chinothanana awe mwanene.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itturi chiri chinchi, nansho iruttu irii imoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Thoko iruttu chiri aya imoka yo itturi chinchi, ni itturi chiyo chonkhaye ihokhalharu chiri chinchi phi nopanga iruttu imoka, phiri aya chiicho wa Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ukhalhawaya hiyaano, nakhalhaka Ayahudi ama Ayunani, ipotta ama aneethi, onkhaye nibatiiziye wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku mmoka mu iruttu imoka iyo ni onkhaye nahompochera Iphumu ya Nlhuku mmoka uyo.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Ukhalhawaya iruttu khirina itturi imoka vekha, nansho irina itturi chinchi. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Yakhalhaka etu mweto waaneera, “Ukhalhawaya mii akihiwe moono, paahi mii akihiwe nhakhu wo iruttu.” Chani, waanohiya ukhalha itturi yo iruttu? Mena! <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Yakhalhaka nnyaru naaneera “Ukhalhawaya mii akihiwe niitho, paahi etu mii akihiwe nhakhu wo iruttu.” Chani, wo nenno nlhove nno nanhiya ukhalha itturi mwiiruttuni? Mena! <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Iruttu yonkhaye yakaari niitho, wiiwa ukaari vayi? Ni iruttu yonkhaye yakaari nnyaru, ntu akonrie chani unukha? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Nansho Nlhuku ahoopa itturi kila imoka mwiiruttuni thoko chaathanana awe. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Yakhalhaka itturi chonkhaye chakaari itturi imoka, iruttu ikaari vayi? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ikekhiaye irii wiira, itturi cho iruttu chiri chinchi, nansho iruttu inokhalha imoka.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Paahi, niitho khaninooria wiirelha moono, Akinoothananani inyuva mena muru khunooria wiirelha mieto, Akinoothananani mwaattiva. <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Anthepa vavawo, inoonia wiira itturi cho iruttu chinoonia ukhalha cho uhuperia chilhe phi chiyo chiri cho ukhulhuvelhiya chinene. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Tho, itturi cho iruttu chinaanyihera ihu ukhalha cho uhiphwanelhiya uthimichiya chinene chilhe, phi chiyo chinothimicha ihu chinene, ni itturi chihinoonihiya waattuni phi noshungiya chinene, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />uno itturi chikina khachinothananiya ulhohiya. Nlhuku mwanene hoopa iruttu wo iphiro chinothanana awe, nkaahelha nthimicho chinene itturi iwukuwelhiye nthimicho ilhe, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />wiira uhikhalhe umwalhaana mwiiruttuni, nansho itturi chonkhaye chihimelhelhaneke chineneru. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Itturi imoka yarakalhaka, itturi chonkhaye chihorakalha vamoka ni iyo. Itturi imoka yatotopelhiyaka itturi chikina chonkhaye chinooteelhiya vamoka ni iyo.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Paahi, mwaattiva onkhaye phi iruttu ya Kuristo, kila mmoka inyu phi itturi cho yeyo iruttu iyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Nlhuku haathanlha attu mmilhokoni mwa attu awe, achokholhaka akarumiya, onayelhi anamilhohi, o neraru owiittuchiha, amalhekeru heesha alhe arii ni mahalha o upanga cho ushangiha ni olhamiha ni okaviha ni ahoolhelhi ni attu owulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Chani, onkhaye phi akarumiya? Onkhaye phi anamilhohi? Onkhaye phi owiittuchiha? Onkhaye phi attu arii ni mahalha o upanga cho ushangiha? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Chani, onkhaye phi attu ari ni mahalha o ulhamiha? Chani, onkhaye phi attu ari ni mahalha o wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto? Chani, onkhaye phi attu anolhamulha nuulhumo nilheto? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Nkhalheke etu ni nikakata no upatta mahalha o ukhulhuvelhiya chinene. Ni mii vano kinowoonihani iphiro yoombone chinene upwaha chilha chonkhaye chilha.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Uttunana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ata kinolhumachaka nuulhumo na attu ni ata no minepa, yakhalhaka akirina nrima wo uttuna, kinokhalha thoko ndebe no uhikhalha ittu ama maruchulhu vanorumihiya aya. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Thoni, kinakhalhaka ni mahalha o namilhohi a Nlhuku, nkakaachuwelha chivithiye chonkhaye ni uchuwelha kila ittu kinowooria ukhalha ni nrima mwinchi kaanooria ata uthamiha miako, nansho yakhalhaka akirina nrima wo uttuna, miyaano akihiwe ittu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Kakumihaka nhakhu aka wonkhaye ni waavaha amashikini, tho kakumihaka iruttu aka wiira ipahiye vamooroni, nansho yakhalhaka akirina nrima wo uttuna kinopatta ittu iriyoothe.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Ntu ri ni nrima wo uttuna noovilhelha, nowaalhoha akina ri ni nrima wo uttuna kharina ihache, khaneechoona ni wala khaneefuna. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Ntu ri ni nrima wo uttuna khanhiya umanya, khanothotha ifaida awe, ama khanrushiya chitema mena khanoopuwelha chittu cho unanara chivinre, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />khanottapelhelha chittu cho uhilhoka, nansho nottapelhelha chittu cho ikeekhene. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Ntu ri ni nrima wo uttuna noovilhelha chonkhaye, noorumelhelha, nookhulhuvelha chonkhaye ni winkelha chittu chonkhaye. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Uttuna khummalha mena. Yakhalhaka ahaawo mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku, yayo anoopotera nihuku nimoka yakhalhaka ahaawo mahalha o wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto, anowuuma yakhalhaka uhaawo uchuwelha chittu ni chiyo chinoovira. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ukhalhawaya uchuwelha wihu khuntimira rata ni mahalha ihu o anamilhohi a Nlhuku khanotimira rata. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Nansho alhe atiminre rata alhe, vanohalha aya uwa ukhuma wiirimu, chonkhaye chihitiminre chinoothamihiya.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Vaari aka mwanhima koolhumacha inamwane, kaachuwelha inamwane, irusho chaka choopuwelha inamwane. Nansho vano, ukhalhawaya ki ntu o wunnuwa, kihohiya malhove e inamwane. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Ukhalhawaya chinoona ihu vano chiri thoko ikhoveru ihinoonia rata mmaashini, nansho miholho uwo ninoowa noona ikhove wo ikhove. Vano kinochuwelha vakaniru, nansho miholho uwo kinoowa kaachuwelha chonkhaye ratarata, thoko Nlhuku vanokichuwelha awe. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Vano kinovarelha alha mararu alha, upisha nrima ni ukhulhuvelha ni uttuna. Nansho nrima wo uttuna phi thepilhe upwaha onkhaye.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Mahalha makina o Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Mmindeke ukhalha ni nrima wo uttuna. Ni chiichammo tho nkhalheke ni nrima wo upatta mahalha makina o munnepani, hasa mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Ukhalhawaya ntu nooria wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto khanoolhumacha ni attu nansho noolhumacha ni Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya wo ikekhiaye khaawo neewa chinohimiya. Yoyo noolhumacha malhove avithiye wo machiri o Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Nansho ri ni mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku, noolhumacha ni attu wo nlhatu wo waatheka ni waamaalhiha ni waahelha nrima. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Ntu noolhumacha nuulhumo nilheto neetheka mwanene. Nansho ntu rina mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku, naatheka attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Paahi, kinothanana mwaattiva onkhaye va muulhumacheke wo nuulhumo nilheto. Nansho hasa kaathananne nkhalhe ni mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku. Ukhalhawaya ntu rina mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku nowiiwiya chinene umpwaha ulhe noolhumacha nuulhumo nilheto yaahikhalheke wiira haawo vavawo ntu nooria ulhamulha malhove anolhumacha awe, ikhalhe iphiro yo waatheka attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Wo chiichammo, ashilhoko aka, kawaaka uwaninyu ni wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto inolhoha ulhokani ittu yaani? Khinoolhokani ittu iriyoothe, yahikalheke koohimeriakani mwaha wo upatakulha wa Nlhuku ama cho mu uchuwelhani ama nttenga wa Nlhuku ama meettuchiho makina. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Phiri aya wo ikerero chihiri chikumi chinoruma thoko ampeta ama imbira. Chani, ntu nohalha uchuwelha chani nchipo nineepiya yakhalhaka ikerero chiyo khachinoruma vanoopiya aya? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Tho nipalhapata narumaka wo uhiwaniaa, mpani nolhoha wiicheesha rata waatakana ikhoto? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Chiichammo ni inyu mwaatti, nlhimi ninyu naahoolhumacheke ittu yo wiiwania, mpani nohalha uchuwelha ittu inoolhumacha inyu? Malhove inyu anoopotera mphioni. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ahaawo moolhumo menchi o kila nikosho velhaponi va, ni mena khaniwo ata nimoka aya nihirii no maana. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Nansho yakhalhaka mii akirina ikuru yo uchuwelha maana o nuulhumo ninoolhumacha awe ntu nkina, mii ki o uhishoma uwannyawe yoyo ntu uyo ni uyo chiicho o uhishoma uwannyaka.<verse eid="1CO 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Chiichammo ni inyu mwaati, ukhalhawaya nhanaa nrima wo upatta mahalha o Iphumu ya Nlhuku, mmindeke chinene upatta chilhe chinohalha ukavihani waatheka attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Wo chiichammo etu, ntu noolhumacha nuulhumo nilheto alhapelheke wiira oorie ulhamulha. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ukhalhawaya, kalhapelhaka wo nuulhumo nilheto nrima aka phi nolhapelha, nansho irusho chaka chinoohalha wo uhimma ittu. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Kipangekeni etu? Kinohalha ulhapelha ni nrima aka, tho kinolhapelha ni irusho chaka, kinowiipa ni nnepa aka, tho kinowiipa ni irusho chaka. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Mwantotopelhaka Nlhuku wo nrima inyu vekha, anohalha wooria chani attu ahinachuwelha chittu arii vanokumaaniya waakhulha Aye, yakhalhaka khaneewa ittu inohimiya vanoshukuru inyu? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ukhalhawaya inyuva nnonshukuru Nlhuku wo ikekhiaye, nansho ntu nkina uyo khinomuncherera ittu.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku wiira mii kinowulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto wuupwahani mwaattiva onkhaye va. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Nansho unokumaana aya attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo phi ninothanana aka chinene wulhumacha malhove nthanu o irusho chaka wiira keettuchihe akina, kuliko wulhumacha malhove maelufu o nuulhumo nilheto. <verse eid="1CO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Ashilhoko aka, irusho chinyu chihikalhe thoko ashinamwane. Vachulhu mwaha wo mu uwonyani, nkhalheke wo uhiwonya thoko ashinamwane ashinkani, nansho vanoopuwelha inyu vavawo nkhalheke thoko attu akhomanlhe. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Iholhepiya nhina Malhehero a ashinna Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Athithi aneera choo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Wo iphiro ya attu anoolhumacha nuulhumo nilheto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Ni wo malhaku a alheto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Kinowoolhumana alha attu alha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Inakhalhaka wiira, khanokiiwelhelha.’ ”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Chiichammo etu, mahalha o wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto phi nthonyero, nihikhalhaka wo nlhatu no attu o nrima, nansho wo nlhatu wa attu ahiri ni nrima. Ukhalhawaya mahalha o anamilhohi a Nlhuku arii wo nlhatu no attu anorumelhelha ni mena kuhiwe wo nlhatu no attu o uhirumelhelha.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Paahi, attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo vanokumaana aya vamoka, nkayaachokholha wulhumacha wo nuulhumo nilheto, chani, vavawo yawaaka attu ahichuwenlhe nenno nuulhumo nilheto nno, khanaanyihera wiira mwaattiva mwa attu o ihalhahalha? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Nansho awaaka attu ahinachuwelha nuulhumo nilheto nno ama o uhirumelhelha attu a Nlhuku vanohimiacha aya nttenga wa Nlhuku, malhove onkhaye anohalha aya wiiwa anowaachuwelhiha uhilhoka waya ni wiihukumulha ashineneru. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Chittu chivithiye mmamirimani mwaya chinoohumbukulhiya, ni ayo anookhoroma ni unthimicha Nlhuku eeraka, “Wo ikekhiaye Nlhuku ri vamoka ni inyu.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iphiro cho ukumaana attu a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ashilhoko aka, niireke chani etu? Vanokumaana inyu vamoka, mmoka eepeke nchipo no unthimicha Nlhuku, nkina eettuchiheke, nkina akhalheke ni ittu yo upatakulhiya ni Nlhuku, nkina ooniheke mahalha o wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto ni nkina alhamulheke anoolhumachiya. Chonkhaye chikhalheke wo nlhatu wo waatheka attu a Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Yakhalhaka ahawo attu arii ni mahalha o wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto, yuulhumacheke attu elhi ama araru, ahithepe vavawo, tho olhumacheke mmoka mmoka, ni akhalheke ntu o ulhamulha anoolhumachiya ayo. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nansho yakhalhaka khaawo nooria ulhamulha, paahi, owulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto amaalheke vakumaaniye attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo vawo, olhumacheke ni nrima awe mwanene ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Vachulhu yo alhe arii ni mahalha o anamilhohi o uhimiacha nttenga wa Nlhuku, yuulhumacheke attu elhi ama araru, ni akina achuwelheke rata malhove aya.<verse eid="1CO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Yakhalhaka mmoka vanoolhumacha awe ntu nkina neewelhelha hopatakulhelhiya ukhuma wa Nlhuku, paahi ulhe noolhumacha ulhe amalhiheke ni ummaha nkhunanawe. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ukhalhawaya onkhaye nnowooria ukhalha anamilhohi o uhimiacha nttenga wa Nlhuku, mmoka khuwaaka nkina, wiira onkhaye mpatte ittu yo wiittucha ni uhelhiya nrima. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Ntu vaheriye nrima wo anamilhohi wo uhimiacha nttenga wa Nlhuku avarelheke yayo mahalha ayo. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku khanttuna injarare, nothanana mpuha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Thoko chinre aya wo ulhemalhelha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />manyaathiyana amaalheke yii unokumaana aya attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. Kharina nipesha no wulhumacha nansho eetimarikheke thoko chinohimia aya Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Yakhalhaka ahanaa malhove o ukoha, yaakoheke manyaowannyaya mmanupani mwaya, ukhalhawaya inowuulhiha muru nthiyana wulhumacha vaattuni unokumaana aya attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Chani, nnanyihera wiira nlhove na Nlhuku nikhumilhe uwaninyu mwaattiva ama niwiilhe uwaninyu vekha inyu? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe naanyihera wiira yoyo phi namilhohi a Nlhuku ama wiira hanaa mahalha o munnepani, achuwelheke etu wiira alha anolhepa aka uwaninyu mwaattiva alha phi malhehero a Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ni attu ahinlhohe ntu hichuwenlhe yayo meettuchiho aka ayo.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Wo chiichammo etu, ashilhoko aka, nkhalheke ni nrima wo uthanana ukhalha anamilhohi o utangacha nttenga wa Nlhuku, nansho nhinchiichihe ntu wulhumacha nuulhumo nilheto. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Nansho kila ittu ipangiyeke wo urata ni wo mpuha.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Uhihimmwa wa Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Vano etu ashilhoko aka, kinothanana uwuupushani Malhove Orera yohimenrieakani alhe, ni inyu nkamwaapochera ni weemelha wo machiri nhina mwaya. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Nnowoopolhiya wo iphiro yo Malhove Orera vanohalha inyu uvarecheshaka malhove yuuhimenrieakani ama yaahikhalheke chiicho urumelhelha winyu unkhalha wo nshatha.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Mii kahoovahani mwaattiva malhove o ulhoka chinene kaapochenre aka wiira Kuristo aakhwenlhe nlhatu no uwonya wihu thoko chilhepiye aya ni Malhove Matakatifu <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />wiira ahovithiya, nkaahihimmwa nihuku no neraru thoko chilhepiye aya ni Malhove Matakatifu, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />wiira ahaakhumelhelha Nakefa ni kaanyuma aya ahaakhumelhelha akarumiya khumi ni elhi alhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Amalheke ahaakhumelha milhoko cha attu enchi aapwaha imia nthanu wo ikatema imoka, enchi aya ahawo akumi mpaka nna, nansho akina aya ahomalha ukhwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Kaanyuma aya ahaakhumelhelha Nayakhobo ahima aya Athithi, amalheke ahaakhumelhelha akarumiya onkhaye. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Yamalheke onkhaye ayo, nkaakikhumelhelha mii, kaari thoko ntu hiyarelhe wo kawaida. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ukhalhawaya mii phi mwankani chinene munlhokoni mwa akarumiya, ni mena akimphwanelhiya ata wiihaniya karumiya, wo nlhatu no waapangelha chittu cho unanara attu a Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Nansho, wo nnema wa Nlhuku, kihokhalha thoko chiri aka, ni nnema wawe uwannyaka, khawaari wo nshatha. Mii kihovara ntheko waapwaha onkhaye, akihena mii hasa, nansho nnema wa Nlhuku unovara ntheko vamoka ni mii. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Nansho inakhalhaka chiicho, ikhalhe ayo phi nohimiacha nttenga wa Nlhuku ama mii phi nohimiacha, khave ittu. Ni ilha phi iyo inohimiacha ihu ni ilha phi iyo inorumelhelha inyu.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhihimushiya wihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Vano ukhalhawaya nttenga unoohimiachiya wiira Kuristo hohihimushiya, anooria chani etu attu akina munlhokoni mwinyu wulhumacha wiira khuuwo uhihimushiya wa attu? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Yakhalhaka etu khuuwo uhihimushiya wa attu, paahi, Kuristo ni uyo kaahihimmwe, <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />ni yakhalhaka Kuristo kaahihimmwe, paahi uhimiacha wihu khurina ittu ni upisha nrima wihu khurina ittu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Wo uthepa vavawo, ni hii etu nanokhalha o uhimiechesha o woothacha wa Nlhuku ukhalhawaya naheera wiira Nlhuku ahonhihimusha Kuristo, nansho khanhihimunshe yakhalhaka we ikekhiaye attu akhwilhe khanohihimushiya.<verse eid="1CO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ukhalhawaya yakhalhaka ikeekhene wiira attu akhwilhe khanohihimmwa, paahi etu Kuristo ni uyo khaahihimmwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Ni yakhalhaka wiira Kuristo khaahihimushiye, paahi etu nrima winyu urii wo nshatha bado mwaatti nrii mu uwonyani, <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />ni vavawo tho, attu onkhaye akhwilhe analhutaanne ni Kuristo, ahopotera. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Yakhalhaka etu ukhulhuvelha wihu nhina Kuristo unaacha ukumi wo vano ulha vekha aya, paahi etu, hii phi attu o woonelhiya ikiriri chinene waapwaha attu akina onkhaye velhaponi va.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Nansho ikeekhene iri wiira, Kuristo hohihimushiya, aaholhelhaka anorupa nnookhwani alhe. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Ukhalhawaya thoko nookhwa chaawihiye awe ni ntu mmoka, phi chiichammo uhihimmwa wa attu akhwilhe uwiihiye aya ni ntu mmoka. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Thoko attu chinokhwa aya ni ulhutaana ni Adamu, phi chiichammo attu onkhaye chinohalha aya uhihimushiya wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Nansho kila mmoka noohihimmwa kila mmoka wo ikatema awe, Kuristo achokholhaka, khuttwaraka alhe arii awawe Kuristo ikatema vanohalha awe uwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Yamalhakaru, ikatema yo umalhelha inoowa Kuristo vanohalha awe waavaha umwene Nlhuku Athithi, vanowa awe umalhiha ufuta kila imwene ni ikuru ni machiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ukhalhawaya Kuristo lazima ataware mpaka vanohalha awe waawulhusha amalhaponi awe ni waanyikalhelha wuuthi inyaa chawe. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Mmalhaponi nohalha umalhihera unyikalhelhiya nowa ukhalha nookhwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />“Nlhuku honyikalhiha chittu chonkhaye wuuthi inyaa chawe,” paahi etu, vaneera aya, Chittu chonkhaye chihonyikalhelhiya wuuthi inyaa chawe wiira ataware phi ikeekhene wiira Nlhuku khanothakaneelha mu yoyo nkutira wo chittu uyo. Ukhalhawaya yoyo phi neesha chittu chonkhaye wuuthi inyaa cha Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Nansho chittu chonkhaye vanohalha aya weeshiya mmathathani mwa ikuru ya Kuristo, phi vavawo Mwaana ni uyo vanohalha awe wiicheesha mmathathani mwa Nlhuku eenshe chittu chonkhaye mmathathani mwawe, wiira Nlhuku ataware vachulhu chittu chonkhaye. <verse eid="1CO 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Yakhalhaka etu uhihimmwa khuuwo, chani attu anobatiiziya wo nlhatu na attu akhwilhe anokhulhuvelha upatta ittu yaani? Yakhalhaka attu akhwilhe khanohihimmwa, yeeshiyani etu ubatiiziya wo nlhatu waya? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Ni hii etu, yeeshiyani wiihelha ntatakoni kila ikatema? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Ashilhoko aka, mii kirii nnookhwani kila nihuku! Wiishipa urina aka urii wo mu ulhutaanani winyu ni Kuristo Yesu, Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Nansho waatakana waka ni ashinama o Uefeso ukaari wo munttuni kikaapantte ittu yaani? Yakhalhakaru attu khanhihimmwa, nilhieke niwurieke etu, ukhalhawaya meelho ninookhwaacha.<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nhithepiachiye! Unlhoko wo uhilhoka, unootanganya meetelho orera. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Munkweke! Nchokholheke ukhalha makhalhelho orera, nhiyeke uwonya. Yeyo kinoohimeriani wiira irii yo wuulhiha muru chinene uwaninyu mwaatti ukhalhawaya akina inyu khanonchuwelha Nlhuku mena!<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iruttu yo uhihimushiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Nansho ntu nowooria ukoha, “Attu akhwilhe anohalha uhihumushiya chani? Anowa ukhalha ni iruttu yo wiira chani?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Cheechiyo phi chookohiya cho uhikhalha maana! Mwaalhakaru imbeyu ikumi, yaahikhweeke khinomelha. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Inaalha inyu phi imbeyuru, veekinaka yo ingaano ama yo yolhia ikina, ni mena kuhiwe iruttu yo nnyepu nkumi unohalha umelha kaanyuma. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Nlhuku noovaha yeyo imbeyu iyo nnyepu inothanana awe mwanene, kila imbeyu ipattaka iruttu inolhikaana aya.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Iruttu cho chittu chonkhaye chuupiye khachinlhikaana. Iruttu cha attu khachinlhikaana, cha ashinama chiri cho inamuna chikina, cha ashinuni chiri chikina ni cho ihopa chiri chikina. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Chihaawo iruttu cho wiirimu ni iruttu cho mwiilhaponi, nthimicho wo iruttu cho wiirimu uri nkina ni urera wo iruttu cho mwiilhaponi uri nkina. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Uhaawo urera wo nchuwa ni nkina wo mweeri ni wo ittotwa, ata ni ittotwa ni chiyo chihaawo chihinlhikaana urera waya.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Phiri aya chiicho mwaha wo uhihimmwa. Thoko imbeyu chiri aya, iruttu phi inowuhelhiya nttayani nkayonta, nansho inohihimushiya ikhalhaka yo uhuunta. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Inowuhelhiya inari ihithimichiyaka, nansho inohihimushiya inari ni nthimicho, inowuhelhiya yo uhuperia nansho inohihimmwa ikhalhaka yo machiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Vanowuhelhiya aya inokhalha yo velhaponi irina ihu ilha, nansho vanohihimmwa aya inokhalha iruttu yo mminepani. Ukhalhawaya ihaawo iruttu yo kawaida ni uhihimmwa iruttu yo munnepani. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Ntu o upacha, Adamu aari yo wuupiya yo ukumi.” Nansho Adamu o umalhelha phi Iphumu ya Nlhuku naavaha attu ukumi.<verse eid="1CO 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Nansho inoholhelha kihiwe iruttu yo munnepani, nansho iruttu yo kawaida ilhe, tho khuwaaka iruttu yo munnepani. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Ntu o upachera wuupiya Adamu, aakhumme nttayani, Adamu o nayelhi aakhumilhe wiirimu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Onkhaye arii velhaponi ari thoko yoyo ntu oopiye nttayani uyo, ni ayo arii wiirimu anokhalha thoko uyo aakhumme wiirimu uyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Thoko chinre ihu wo ulhikaana ni uyo oopiye nttayani uyo, phi chiichammo chinohalha ihu ulhikaana ni uyo aakhumme wiirimu uyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Paahi etu ashilhoko aka mii kineera, iruttu ni iphome khachinooria uhiyeriya umwene wa Nlhuku ni ittu yo wuunta khinooria uhiyeriya uhuunta. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Mwiiwelhelheke etu kuuhimerieni ittu ivithiye, hii khaninokhwa onkhaye, nansho ninowa urukunushiya <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />ikatema yo nrombe no umalhelha, uphilha ni upathusha miitho. Ukhalhawaya nipalhapata no umalhelha vanohalha aya wiiwania noopiyaka, attu akhwilhe anoowa aahihimushiya wo iphiro yo ukumi uhinokhwa tho, ni hii ninoowa naarukunushiya. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Ukhalhawaya ihophwanelhiya kila ittu yo wuunta iware uhuunta, iruttu yo ukhwa iwarihiye uhikhwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Paahi etu iruttu yo wuunta ilha vanohalha aya urukunushiya ukhalha yo uhuunta ni ittu yo ukhwa vanohalha aya urukunushiya ukhalha yo uhikhwa, phi vavawo vanohalha aya utimira nlhove nilhepiye nne, “Nookhwa hokottolhiya!” <verse eid="1CO 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Uwe nookhwa ukottolha wao uri vayi? Uwe nookhwa uri vayi uweria wao?” <verse eid="1CO 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Nookhwa nopatta machiri o weeria wawe mu uwonyani, ni machiri o uwonya phi Malhehero. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Nansho ninshukuruku Nlhuku nonivaha machiri o ukottolha wo iphiro ya Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Paahi etu ashilhoko aka kinaattuna aka, mweemelheke rata nhitikhinyie. Nthepeke mahuku onkhaye ukuruvalhelha ntheko wo waakavihera Athithi, nchuwelhaka wiira ntheko unopanga inyu wa Athithi khunowa waapotera wo nshatha.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ukumiha ittu yo waakavihera attu a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Vano phi mwaha unaacha ukumiha ittu wo nlhatu no attu a Nlhuku, mpangeke thoko chinre aka wo waalhehera attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo anokhalha Ugalatiya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Kila ntu munlhokoni mwinyu echeshereke nchurukhu kila jumaapili thoko chipantte awe. Ikhalhe wiira akhalhaneke ittu yo ukumiha nihuku no unlhapelha Nlhuku. Nihiwe naakhumelhelha nlhove no upangiya nchango ikatema vanohalha aka uwa. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ikatema vanohalha aka uwa uwaninyu vawo, kinoowa kaaruma attu mwaathanlhe inyu wiira arweehe iwarakha ni isawadi chinyu cho uttuna Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Yalhokaka wiira ni mii kirwee wowo, kinowaattukana etu.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moopuwelho a Napaolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Kinoowa wowo kamalhaka uvirelha Umakedoniya ukhalhawaya kiholhakelha uvirelha Umakedoniya uwo. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Veekinaka kinoowa kaakhalha uwaninyu wo mahuku vakani, ama veekinaka kinoowa kaakhalha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti nlhaalha wonkhaye wo uririya, wiira mmwe mwaakikaaviha nkwaha uriwoothe unohalha aka urwaa. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Akinottuna uvirelha uwaninyu uwo chitemachitema ni urwaa munkwahani. Kinokhulhuvelha wiira, Athithi akivaheraka, kinoowa kaakhalha uwaninyu uwo mahuku vakani.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nansho kinoolhokelha Vaefeso va mpaka nihuku no Pentekote. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Nlhako wo nlhatu no ntheko waka uhopatakuwa vaa, inakhalhaka wiira ahawo attu anokivinga, ni ayo ari enchi.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Natimotheo yawaakaru, mwaapochereke rata, wo uhikhalha nipampa, ukhalhawaya anopanga ntheko wa Athithi thoko chiri aka mii. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Paahi etu ntu riyoothe haaveehe nansho mwaakaviheke athepeke urwaa nkwaha waya wo mpuharu wiira yamalhaka, ahokolhie uwannyaka ukhalhawaya ninowaaweherera mii vamoka ni ashilhoko ihu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Wo mwaha unomwaacha munnihu Naapolo, kihaachontelhelha chinene wiira aweeke uwaninyu uwo vamoka ni manyonnihu akina, nansho khanttuna uwa ilha ikatema ilha, anohalha uwa apattaka nipesha kaanyuma.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhove o umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Nshiheke, mweemelheke rata wo nrima, mmindeke, nkhalheke ni machiri. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Kila ittu inopanga inyu mpangeke wo nrima wo uttuna.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Ashilhoko aka, nhochuwelha iwani i Nastefana, yayo phi attu o upacha upochera nrima wo Ikuristo Uakaya, ni ayo aheekumiha waakavihera attu a Nlhuku. Kinoulhepelhani mwaatti wiira, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />nttwareke uholhelhi wa attu thoko yayo, ni uholhelhi wa kila ntu novara ntheko ni ukaviha vamoka ni ayo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Kinooteelhiya nrima chinene wiira Nastefana ni Afotunato ni Akaiko ahowa, ahotiya vakittu vahaatiminre wo nlhatu no uhikhalha winyu vaa. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Ahoteelhiha nrima aka ni mirima chinyu tho. Paahi iholhoka woopuwelha attu thoko yayo.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Attu a Nlhuku onkhaye o Uasiya anouvahani isalamu. Naakwila ni Aprisila vamoka ni attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye anokumaana unupani waya anouvahani isalamu chinchi muulhutaanani Athithi. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Ashilhoko ihu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo onkhaye anouvahani isalamu. Ni inyu kila mmoka ammaheke nkhunanawe mmono wo ibarakha chitakatifu cho uttuna wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Miyaano Paolo kinouvahani isalamu chinolhepa aka wo moono aka kimwanene. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ntu riyoothe hinaattuna Athithi, yoyo alhaviyeke. Thithi, nkawaani!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Kinowulhapelhani nnema wa Athithi Yesu ukhalheke ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Uttuna waka ukhalheke uwaninyu wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo Yesu. Aye.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>